      "text": "Penblwydd hapus i Evardi Bosdhoff 🥳\nMwynhewch eich diwrnod arbennig // Enjoy your day 🎂\n#OurBloodIsBlack",
      "author": "Ospreys Rugby",
      "handle": "ospreysofficial.bsky.social",
